{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45635","headline":"寄高员外 · 贯休","name":"寄高员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冷冽苍黄风似劈，雪骨冰筋满瑶席。\n庭松流污相抵吃，霜絮重裘火无力。\n孤峯地鑪烧白枥，庞眉道者应相忆。\n儵忽维阳岁云暮，寂寥不觉成章句。\n惟应将寄蘂珠宫，禅刹云深一来否。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}